rare_chars algorithm and tables
======================================

Adapted from https://github.com/RinshannKaihou/self_evolving_inference_detector
(package v35_detector 0.4.0; research commit 5118334).

Files under this directory (rare.py, rare_vocab.py, rare_gb.py, rare_ref.py,
rare.json, tables/rare_gb.npz) preserve the evaluated detector logic and the
shared GB artifact. Per-tokenizer rare tables are built at Guard warmup from
the served tokenizer. Guard wiring, Ascend (top1, chosen) logprob
collection, and the ConfigBackedDetector wrapper live outside this package.
